{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7c3f9090-2b75-8c12-8665-b1a1b267fd2f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:13:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:04:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. Um, this is Carlos Furtado. I'm calling about my car. It's plowed in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, plowed in. Hang on, let me grab a pen. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "446 Bliss Road. Over on the Easton's Beach side. Sorry, I'm walking, I'm just heading back from the corner, so if I thump into the phone, that's me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. 446 Bliss Road. And the car, is it parked on the street or in a driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, hold on. Street. It's on the street in front of the house. The city plow went by, I'd say, Monday night, and it left a wall of that heavy stuff right along the side. Packed solid. It's wet, it's like cement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that snow-to-rain stuff from Sunday into Monday is the worst. Heavy as anything. So the plow pushed it up against the driver's side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 34,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both sides, really. Front and the whole driver's side. I tried to dig it out this morning with a shovel. Gave up after ten minutes. Hold on, I wrote this down so I'd get it right. [pause] Okay. Where is it. Okay, I wrote, 'bank is about three feet high at the front bumper.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three feet at the bumper. Got it. I'm writing that down. Three feet, front and driver's side, Bliss Road, 446."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:07:19-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And it's not like I parked in a weird spot. I was on the street where I always am. So my question is, when is somebody going to clear it? Because I have to be at work tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:07:43-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So what usually happens is the plow crews finish the main passes first, and then they go back for cleanup on the residential streets. Bliss Road would be in that second round. Realistically you're looking at a day or two, maybe a little more depending on what else came in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. So that's, what, Wednesday, Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somewhere in there, yeah. I'll put the request in so it's on the list for your street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but, um, will they actually clear my car out, or do they just, like, widen the street and leave the pile where it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:08:48-05:00",
      "duration": 34,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, they're not going to dig out individual cars. The plows aren't set up for that. What I can do is flag that there's a heavy bank on your street and have them take a look at it. But the last bit around the car, that's probably going to be on you with a shovel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course it is. [pause] Sorry, I'm crossing, there's a truck. Okay. So they push it on my car, and I dig it out. Great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's an annoying thing and I get this call every storm. It's just how the plows work on those narrow streets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Alright. Well, it's the rain that made it so heavy. Whatever. Can you at least put it in so they come back through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Let me get this logged. Name is Carlos, C-A-R-L-O-S, and last name Furtado, F-U-R-T-A-D-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the address again, 446 Bliss Road. Do you have a number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-seven. Got it. So I'm logging a plowed-in vehicle, heavy bank at the front and the driver's side, request for a return pass."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Is there any way to know which day? Like, can I move the car? If I could get it out I'd park somewhere else for a night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:09-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you can get it out, that's honestly the best move, because then the crew can get right up to the curb. Anything on the street when they come, they have to plow around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "See, that's the thing, I can't get it out. That's why I'm calling. [pause] Okay. Sorry. Hold on, I'm at my steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm here. Okay. So if I dig just the front, do you think that's enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Depends how the bank sits behind you. If you can clear the front and make a path to go forward or back about a car length, you might rock it out. Worst case, clear the tires on the driver's side and a lane in front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll try that after lunch. It's a lot of work for something the city did."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And I put in your note that it's the city plow bank, so they know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. So, Wednesday or Thursday, that's what you're telling me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wednesday is possible, Thursday more likely. If it's still sitting there Friday morning, call back and give me the address, and I'll see where it stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll do that. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Carlos. Good luck with the shoveling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
